OL,3,GNEWSAOzzfest returning to Milton Keynes
OL,4,Afor 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FOzzfest 2027 will return to Milton
OL,7,FKeynes for what will be its first
OL,8,Ffestival since the Black Sabbath
OL,9,Ffrontman's death last year.
OL,11,FIn March, Sharon Osbourne said plans
OL,12,Fwere being made to bring the heavy
OL,13,Fmetal festival, which she founded with
OL,14,Fher husband Ozzy Osbourne, to Villa
OL,15,FPark in Birmingham for next year.
OL,17,FHowever, the official website has
OL,18,Frevealed the event will take place at
OL,19,Fthe National Bowl in Milton Keynes on
OL,20,F10 July.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
